menu "Lume WiFi OTA (r26)"
    config LUME_OTA_PORT
        int "WiFi OTA TCP listen port"
        default 8765
        range 1 65535
        help
            TCP port for the authenticated WiFi OTA push channel. The server
            binds only while the WiFi station has an IPv4 address. The CLI
            selects a non-default port with --ota-port.
endmenu
